// Net Cash (Cash Only)
// Table: _Measures
// Display folder: Category\02 KPI\Liquidity;Pages\03 Debt & Net Cash;Pages\04 Notes & Evidence;Pages\05 Financial Statements
// Format: #,##0
// Hidden: false
// Conservative net cash: Cash & equivalents − Gross Debt (marketable securities and leases excluded). Always available; label it as cash-only on the canvas.

Net Cash (Cash Only) =
VAR _cash = [Cash]
RETURN
IF(ISBLANK(_cash), BLANK(), _cash - COALESCE([Gross Debt], 0))
